}

ComplianceContextFacade --> ComplianceEventRepository
ComplianceContextFacade --> DeviationAlertRepository
ComplianceContextFacade ..> AlertReference
note bottom of ComplianceContextFacade
  findEnvironmentAlerts: incidents of an environment and its containers detected
  in the period, read by the environmental report of Reporting (US95).
end note
CaTenantResourceLookup --> DeviationAlertRepository
note bottom of CaTenantResourceLookup
  alertId -> laboratoryId of the alert
