note bottom of DeviationAlertController
  GET  /api/v1/laboratories/{laboratoryId}/environments/{environmentId}/deviation-alerts
       ?status&severity&deviceId&active                  (US85, TS74)
  POST /api/v1/laboratories/{laboratoryId}/environments/{environmentId}/deviation-alerts
       (TS73: 201 + Location new alert, 200 joined the open alert, 400)
  GET  /api/v1/deviation-alerts/{alertId}                 (US86, with related actions)
  POST /api/v1/deviation-alerts/{alertId}/acknowledgements  (US87, TS75, 201 / 409)
  POST /api/v1/deviation-alerts/{alertId}/resolutions       (US88, TS76, 201 / 409)
  The authenticated user is the actor (CurrentUser); auditors only read.
end note
note bottom of ComplianceEventController
  GET /api/v1/laboratories/{laboratoryId}/equipments/{equipmentId}/compliance-events
  GET /api/v1/batches/{batchId}/compliance-events
end note

